%% frame: Team expiry: one team expires, with its subscribers at commit (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as :TeamExpirySweepJob
    participant Sw as :GroupDealExpirySweeper
    participant Px as proxy : GroupDealExpiryService
    participant Repo as :PaidGroupDealRepository
    participant Deal as before : GroupDeal
    participant OLS as :OrderLifecycleSubscriber
    participant Ref as :TeamExpiryRefundSubscriber
    participant RSvc as :TeamExpiryRefundService
    participant Out as :IntegrationOutboxWriter

    Note over Job,Deal: every PT1M, LeasedJobRunner.run takes the lease "team-expiry-sweep" (PT2M) and calls sweepOnce(leaseValid); if another server holds it, nothing runs
    Job->>Sw: sweep(100, leaseValid)
    Sw->>Repo: currentTime()
    Repo-->>Sw: Instant now
    Sw->>Repo: dueForExpiry(now, limit)
    Repo-->>Sw: List of UUID
    loop each dealId, while leaseValid
        Sw->>Px: expireOne(dealId)
        critical expireOne, REQUIRED, default isolation, 10 s
            Px->>Repo: lockDeal(dealId) {lock 1}
            Repo-->>Px: Optional of GroupDeal
            Px->>Repo: currentTime()
            Repo-->>Px: Instant now
            Px->>Deal: expire(now)
            break DEAL_CLOSED: already resolved
                Deal-->>Px: BizException DEAL_CLOSED
                Px-->>Sw: false
            end
            Deal-->>Px: after (EXPIRED)
            Px->>Repo: expire(before, after, now)
            Note over Px,Out: publishEvent(TeamExpired) on ApplicationEventPublisher only registers the event; at BEFORE_COMMIT the transaction owner calls each listener in @Order (10, 20, then lowest precedence): orders cancelled, one refund obligation per paid member, one TeamExpiredV1 row in sys_outbox
            Px->>OLS: onTeamExpired(event)
            OLS-->>Px: void
            Px->>Ref: onTeamExpired(event)
            Ref->>RSvc: recordExpiredTeam(dealId) {lock 3}
            RSvc-->>Ref: void
            Ref-->>Px: void
            Px->>Out: onTeamExpired(event)
            Out-->>Px: void
        end
        Px-->>Sw: true
    end
    Sw-->>Job: Result(due, expired, alreadyResolved, failed)
